{"id": "34074", "title": "囚婚新娘(旧爱新欢3)", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34074.htm", "intro": "辜宇臣英俊挺拔、能力超群，只可惜个性冰冷，像个机器人。他爽快答应父母的逼婚，因为他根本没爱过哪个女人──可是那个闯进他办公室、又敢回视他的女人，让他起了兴趣！为了她，他决定和安静柔顺的妻子离婚，去追寻“真爱”。谁知他以为的“真爱”，不到几天就令他厌烦至极，让他竟然不由自主、无法控制地深深“怀念”起前妻……杨缮芸无法相信，她的终身大事就这样被决定了！但是她父亲只是辜家的司机，她怎能拒绝嫁给辜家的少爷？婚后她帮他生了一个女儿，甚至不知不觉爱上了丈夫，虽然两人一直相敬如冰，她也以为日子就会这样过下去……他却在这时告诉她，他找到了真爱，所以要抛弃她们母女?!", "base": "files/article/html/34/34074", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2167723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2167724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2167725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2167726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2167727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2167728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2167729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2167730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2167731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2167732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2167733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2167734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2167735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2167736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2167737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2167738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2167739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2167740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2167741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2167742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2167743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2167744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2167745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2167746.html